{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the sum of two numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then the sum of their cubes is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca9c0ad7cd8f9c58ba70a15622c04ecacc99166b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ - 2 - \\frac {3i\\sqrt {3}}{4} \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ - \\frac {3i\\sqrt {3}}{4} \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"497\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the two numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6ad220a107929af3055e7b259dd6e6c1f07c973f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)(a^2 - ab + b^2) = (a+b)[(a+b)^2 -3ab]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"437\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9fd586c01a1c88ca2072638dacb6a7e1b998588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= (1)[1^2 - 3 \\cdot 1] = -2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHS